ively. Item and key spawns are highly randomized, ensuring no two games ever feel the same.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Long and pleasing gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/LYD_Lockpick.gif?t=1747998293\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/extras/13__2_.png?t=1747998293\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> According to the developers, this game may contain content that is not suitable for all ages or for viewing in a professional environment: Violence, gore, and general mature themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Mert \u00c7a\u011flayan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004140/header.jpg?t=1747998293","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257089969,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089969/movie480.mp4?t=1747914278","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089969/movie_max.mp4?t=1747914278"},"name":"LockYourDoor Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257089969/f0b4946f3470fbf3d2c90eb756e149d7de1cd873/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747914278","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089969/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747914278","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089969/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747914278"}}],"name":"LockYourDoor","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></l